"comhéadan: modh diffserv4, ingress 1, egress 1, nat 1, host_isolate 1, "
"autorate_ingress 0. gléas: mar an gcéanna seachas nat 0. réamhshocruithe: "
"timeout 3600, dscp_default_tcp/udp CS0, dscp_prio/dscp_bulk/dscp_icmp unset, "
"bulk_trigger_pps/bulk_trigger_timeout/prio_max_avg_pkt_len 0 (díchumasaithe)."

